1) Sharp rebuttal/op‑ed — argues the court’s temporary injunction on a key enforcement provision is judicial overreach and urges rapid legal and political pushback;  
2) Legal next‑steps analysis — explains the likely appeals path, emergency‑stay options, which enforcement actions are paused now, and immediate policy and political consequences;  
3) Polling roundup (favorable) — latest polls showing continued momentum for your side in key states, with brief notes on methodology and which races remain competitive;  
4) Contrast explainer (tagged, mainstream) — clearly critical of the bill’s legality and implementation and included so you can see the main arguments opponents will use and prepare targeted rebuttals.
